Proactive Timesheet Management: I ensure all timesheets are updated daily without fail. I also review my entries weekly to catch and rectify any discrepancies before submission deadlines.

Adherence to WFO Days: I strictly follow the work-from-office (WFO) requirements set by the organisation and proactively communicate any unavoidable deviations well in advance to ensure alignment.

Completion of Mandatory Training: I prioritise all mandatory training sessions within the stipulated timelines to eliminate the risk of compliance breaches.

Leave Planning and Coordination: I plan my leaves in advance and ensure they are communicated and approved without affecting team deliverables. In case of emergencies, I coordinate promptly with my manager to avoid disruptions.

Comprehensive JIRA Documentation: I maintain up-to-date and accurate documentation in JIRA for all my tasks, ensuring full traceability and compliance with Agile processes.

Active Participation in Agile Ceremonies: I fully engage in Agile ceremonies (daily stand-ups, sprint planning, retrospectives, and reviews) to ensure transparency and alignment with team goals.

Self-Monitoring and Peer Review: I routinely self-check my compliance with timesheets, WFO days, training, and other mandatory processes. I also encourage peer reviews and feedback to identify and mitigate potential breaches early.
